.
.  Generate sample output for Beta PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na betpdf4.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE SIZE 6
TITLE OFFSET 3
LABEL SIZE 6
TIC LABEL SIZE 6
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 13
FRAME CORNER COORDINATES 20 20 90 90
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
THICKNESS 0.2
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
TITLE Beta PDF (0.5, 0.5)
PLOT BETPDF(X,0.5,0.5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Beta PDF (0.5, 2)
PLOT BETPDF(X,0.5,2) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Beta PDF (2, 0.5)
PLOT BETPDF(X,2,0.5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Beta PDF (2, 2)
PLOT BETPDF(X,2,2) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
.
quit
